flowchart LR
    Browser[Browser UI] --> CDN[CloudFront HTTPS and security headers]
    CDN --> Hosting[(Private frontend S3 / OAC)]
    Browser -->|Login / refresh / logout| Cognito[Cognito User Pool]
    Browser -->|JWT| API[API Gateway HTTP API]
    Cognito -.->|JWT authorizer| API
    API --> Handler[API Lambda Python 3.12]
    Handler --> Policies[(DynamoDB Policies)]
    Handler --> Metadata[(Document Metadata / owner and due indexes)]
    Browser -->|Presigned POST and versioned GET| S3[(Private versioned document S3)]
    Handler --> Queue[SQS Document Queue]
    Schedule[EventBridge schedule] --> Recovery[Pending recovery Lambda]
    Recovery --> Metadata
    Recovery --> Queue
    Queue --> Worker[PDF byte verification worker]
    Worker --> S3
    Worker --> Metadata
    Queue -->|Retries exhausted| DLQ[Document DLQ]
    Handler --> CW[CloudWatch Logs metrics dashboard and five alarms]
    Worker --> CW
    Recovery --> CW
    CW --> SNS[SNS alarm topic / zero subscriptions at C0]
